Puls.Description:
PULSE – рухайся в такт з життям!

Завантажте додаток
Використовуйте мапу, щоб побачити скутери поблизу
Відскануйте QR-код на скутері за допомогою програми та насолоджуйтесь подорожжю

З PULSE вам ніколи не доведеться турбуватися про те, щоб ходити занадто довго, замовляти таксі або залежати від розкладу громадського транспорту.

Скутер PULSE – це найкращий спосіб стильно дістатися куди Ви хочете у місті. Це швидкий, комфортний і доступний спосіб пересування!

Пам'ятайте:

Вікові обмеження для наших райдерів 16+;
Не керуйте скутером у не тверезому стані;
Один скутер - один райдер;
Завжди бережіть себе та скутер;
Паркуйтеся у спеціально відведених місцях;

Ознайомтеся з інструкцією, щоб зрозуміти, як користуватися нашим сервісом!

Гарної подорожі!

happiness.Description:
"Happy Restaurant Story" is an innovative time-management and business simulation game that immerses you in the thrilling world of culinary arts. Embark on a journey starting with a cozy family diner and gradually expand your empire on a global scale, aspiring to become a master chef in the culinary world. This game offers more than just the joy of cooking, as it incorporates comprehensive restaurant management elements, allowing players to experience the entire process from ingredient selection and cooking to service.

As customers step into your restaurant, a delightly journey begins. You will need to arrange seating, take orders, and ensure each guest enjoys a perfect dining experience. Progressing through the game, you can enhance your chef team and waitstaff by improving their efficiency. Elevate the quality of dishes to turn every meal into a work of art. Expand your restaurant facilities to attract more customers.

Highlights of the game include:

1. Innovative gameplay mode: Breaking away from the confines of traditional management games, it offers an immersive restaurant management experience;
2. Diversified upgrade system: Upgrade not only chefs and waitstaff but also tables, chairs, and decoration styles according to your preferences;
3. Customizable restaurant environment: Personalize every detail, from murals to tableware, to reflect your own unique taste;
4. Entertaining game props: Use a variety of props to enhance staff proficiency and meet customer demands, elevating the overall dining experience;
5. Wide range of exciting game activities: Combining holidays and special events,  the game introduces limited-time events and exclusive items to keep the gameplay fresh.

Open your charming kitchen, explore delicacies from around the world, and realize your culinary dreams in "Happy Restaurant Story." Every decision you make contributes to the legend of a culinary empire.

walking.Description:
Lose weight combining different walking techniques and daily challenges, based on healthy weight loss principles. It’s easy to start, just enter your parameters, choose goal and fitness level to get the best-matched training program. You may burn fat faster completing up to 3 from dozens daily challenges.

Download app for free and get healthier with GoFit!


Why to go with GoFit?

TRAINING PROGRAMS:

- Daily walking programs for different goals. Walk to lose weight, stay fit or reduce stress;
- SMART training plans, that are made based on your goals and fitness level;
- 3 training modes. Achieve your goal whatever you are beginner, intermediate or advanced;
- Enter your parameters and get individual daily step goal.

EASY WORKOUTS:

- Beginner friendly workouts, that are easy to perform;
- Simple and understandable exercises with instructions;
- Personal assistant with text and voice tips will guide you all the way;
- Easy access to the music during workouts will help you achieve great positive results.

DAILY CHALLENGES:

- Dozens of daily challenges focused on changing your food principles, physical activity and mindset;
- Take 3 of 9 changing daily challenges to get healthier and achieve your final goal faster;
- Daily reminders will make sure you complete all the challenges.

Make little step to big changes - download GoFit now!

- GoFit is free to download;
- GoFit has a free 1-week (7 day) free trial;
- Ongoing use requires an active subscription, available on a weekly or annual basis, depending on your workout, diet and costs.
- All subscription plans offer unlimited access to every walking program in exchange for a single payment during subscription duration.
- Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase
- For your convenience, GoFit subscriptions are set to automatically renew within 24-hour period prior to the subscription end date.
- You can cancel your subscription at any moment in your iTunes account settings but refunds will not be provided for any unused portion of the terms. 
- Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable

